le=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"requirement\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"seller_license\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"license_kind\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"medical_device_establishment\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"route_to_human\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"queue\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"restricted_category_review\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"priority\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"deadline_hours\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">24</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"policy_snapshot\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ps_2026-09-25T14:00:00Z_a41f\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"review_hint\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"核对类目是否应为医疗器械；卖家未提供经营备案\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>其中三个字段值得单独说明。<code>policy_snapshot</code> 是策略快照的标识——判定必须在某个确定版本的策略下产生，否则规则变更后无法解释历史判定。<code>review_hint</code> 是给人工审核员的一句话看点，它显著影响人工判定速度与一致性：让审核员从零判断一件商品通常需要一到数分钟，而带着「只看这一处」的提示可以压缩到十几秒。<code>risk_tier</code> 是给优先级与时限用的分档，它与 <code>confidence</code> 不是一回事——置信度是对「判定是否正确」的把握，风险档是对「判错后果有多严重」的估计，两者独立。</p>\n<h3 id=\"策略快照-判定的版本锚点\">策略快照：判定的版本锚点</h3><p>策略快照是「某一时刻全部生效规则的不可变集合」，它有一个内容哈希与一个时间戳。判定记录引用快照 ID 而不是引用各条规则的版本号之和，这样在规则增删频繁时判定记录不会因悬挂引用而失效。快照的生成、校验、灰度，连同节点侧的验签与原子切换，属于规则下发机制，与 <a href=\"restricted-prohibited-rule\">受限/违禁品规则与品类策略</a> 中的规则编辑面配套——规则的产出与规则的生效是两件事，前者是编辑问题，后者是分发问题。</p>\n<h3 id=\"冲突消解与唯一结果\">冲突消解与唯一结果</h3><p>多条规则同时命中并给出相反动作是常态。消解必须有一个确定且可解释的顺序，且这个顺序本身要写进判定记录，让复核者能验证「为什么最后是这个结论」：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  H[全部命中规则] --&gt; S1{按来源权威性排序}&#10;  S1 --&gt;|法定 &gt; 监管 &gt; 平台| S2{同权威按作用域具体度}&#10;  S2 --&gt;|更具体市场/类目优先| S3{同具体度按声明优先级}&#10;  S3 --&gt; S4{相同则按规则 ID 字典序}&#10;  S4 --&gt; R[唯一结果 + 消解轨迹写入判定记录]&#10;  R --&gt; C{结果是否落在不确定带}&#10;  C --&gt;|是| HR[转人审]&#10;  C --&gt;|否| FIN[自动通过 / 自动拦截]\">graph TD\n  H[全部命中规则] --&gt; S1{按来源权威性排序}\n  S1 --&gt;|法定 &gt; 监管 &gt; 平台| S2{同权威按作用域具体度}\n  S2 --&gt;|更具体市场/类目优先| S3{同具体度按声明优先级}\n  S3 --&gt; S4{相同则按规则 ID 字典序}\n  S4 --&gt; R[唯一结果 + 消解轨迹写入判定记录]\n  R --&gt; C{结果是否落在不确定带}\n  C --&gt;|是| HR[转人审]\n  C --&gt;|否| FIN[自动通过 / 自动拦截]</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 判定落库：一次提交一行判定，命中规则与消解轨迹分表，支持按依据聚合&#10;CREATE TABLE moderation_decisions (&#10;  decision_id      TEXT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  listing_id       TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  seller_id        TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  outcome          TEXT NOT NULL CHECK (outcome IN (&#39;auto_pass&#39;,&#39;auto_block&#39;,&#39;human_review&#39;,&#39;human_pass&#39;,&#39;human_block&#39;)),&#10;  confidence       NUMERIC(4,3) NOT NULL,&#10;  risk_tier        TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  policy_snapshot  TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  decided_at       TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  decided_by       TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;auto&#39;&#10;);&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_decisions_listing  ON moderation_decisions (listing_id, decided_at DESC);&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_decisions_snapshot ON moderation_decisions (policy_snapshot, outcome);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE moderation_rule_hits (&#10;  decision_id  TEXT NOT NULL REFERENCES moderation_decisions (decision_id),&#10;  rule_id      TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  rule_version INT  NOT NULL,&#10;  rule_source  TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  legal_basis  TEXT,&#10;  action       TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (decision_id, rule_id)&#10;);&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_hits_rule ON moderation_rule_hits (rule_id, rule_version);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 判定落库：一次提交一行判定，命中规则与消解轨迹分表，支持按依据聚合</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> moderation_decisions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  decision_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  listing_id       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  seller_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  outcome          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (outcome </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'auto_pass'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'auto_block'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'human_review'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'human_pass'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'human_block'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  confidence       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  risk_tier        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  policy_snapshot  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  decided_at       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  decided_by       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'auto'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_decisions_listing</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> moderation_decisions (listing_id, decided_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_decisions_snapshot</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> moderation_decisions (policy_snapshot, outcome);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> moderation_rule_hits</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  decision_id  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> moderation_decisions (decision_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rule_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rule_version </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rule_source  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  legal_basis  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  action</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (decision_id, rule_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_hits_rule</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> moderation_rule_hits (rule_id, rule_version);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>idx_hits_rule</code> 这个索引看起来不起眼，它却是第四章所有规则迭代与合规报送查询的基础：当需要回答「这条规则在最近三十天拦了多少件、其中多少被申诉翻案」时，全部代价都落在这个索引上。把规则命中做成独立表而不是塞进判定行的 JSON 字段，就是为了让这个聚合能在数据量上亿时仍然可用。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>消解层次</th>\n<th>判据</th>\n<th>冲突示例</th>\n<th>结果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>来源权威性</td>\n<td>法定 &gt; 监管 &gt; 平台政策</td>\n<td>法律禁止 vs 平台允许</td>\n<td>拦截</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>作用域具体度</td>\n<td>更具体的市场/类目优先</td>\n<td>EU 通则 vs DE 特例</td>\n<td>用 DE 特例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>声明优先级</td>\n<td><code>priority</code> 数值升序</td>\n<td>两条同权威同作用域</td>\n<td>数值小者生效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>字典序兜底</td>\n<td>规则 ID 升序</td>\n<td>数值也相同</td>\n<td>保证确定性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>判定是三分而非二分，转人审是设计的一部分，不是失败的兜底。</li>\n<li>两类错误代价不对称且不可逆程度不同，因此拦截阈值必须显著严于通过阈值，中间留不确定带。</li>\n<li>高确定性通过要让系统敢于大批量放行，否则人工队列会被无谓工作占据，一致性反而下降。</li>\n<li>判定输出必须自解释：结果、置信度、风险档、证据、动作、策略快照、看点提示缺一不可。</li>\n<li>判定引用策略快照而非零散规则版本，才能保证规则变更后历史判定仍可解释。</li>\n<li>冲突消解顺序必须确定、可解释，且消解轨迹本身要写进记录供复核验证。</li>\n<li>规则命中要有独立的可索引结构，它是后续误判分析与合规报送的全部查询基础。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><p>本 hub 内：消费判定证据摘要来快速判定的环节见 <a href=\"../human-review-workflow/review-task-dispatch-sla\">审核任务分派与 SLA</a>；判定被挑战的通道见 <a href=\"../appeal-rereview-change/seller-appeal-rereview\">卖家申诉与复审</a>；按规则与依据做聚合统计的指标设计见 <a href=\"../moderation-ops-metric/false-positive-negative-tune\">误判率与规则迭代</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"自动通过/拦截/转人审判定","id":"自动通过-拦截-转人审判定"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：判定的三岔口与两类错误的不对称","id":"核心概念-判定的三岔口与两类错误的不对称"},{"level":3,"text":"通过阈值必须敢于大批量放行","id":"通过阈值必须敢于大批量放行"},{"level":3,"text":"转人审不是失败，是设计的一部分","id":"转人审不是失败-是设计的一部分"},{"level":2,"text":"判定输出的结构","id":"判定输出的结构"},{"level":3,"text":"策略快照：判定的版本锚点","id":"策略快照-判定的版本锚点"},{"level":3,"text":"冲突消解与唯一结果","id":"冲突消解与唯一结果"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"文本/图片/视频自动机审","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/listing-moderation-workflow/policy-auto-moderation/text-image-video-auto"},"next":{"title":"审核任务分派与 SLA","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/listing-moderation-workflow/human-review-workflow/review-task-dispatch-sla"}}